		{
			dependencies: ["0EE9B6F78ACC5E0E"]
			description: [
				"&l&nFTB Industrial Contraptions&r does not use &cFE&r, but uses its own energy system:"
				"● &nZaps&r (⚡)!"
				""
				"You &ccannot use FE&r on FTB:IC machines. However, you can convert Zaps to FE. One Zap is equal to 4 FE."
				""
				"Generators, Cables, and Battery Boxes will connect to FE-using blocks, and will automatically convert their Zaps to FE to power the block."
				""
				"Zaps have a Voltage tier system. The higher Voltage, the more ⚡/t can be transferred."
				""
				"There are 5 tiers:"
				"● Low Voltage (LV) - 32⚡/t"
				"● Medium Voltage (MV) - 128⚡/t"
				"● High Voltage (HV)512⚡/t"
				"● Extreme Voltage (EV) - 2,048⚡/t"
				"● Insane Voltage (IV) - 8,192⚡/t$"
				""
				"Some machines cannot handle higher Voltage, but you can always use lower ones."
			]
