		{
			dependencies: ["1368C642EDAA80D6"]
			description: [
				"The &l&nQuarry&r uses Zaps to mine an area."
				""
				"The Quarry mines all the way down to Bedrock."
				"Mined items will be collected into the Quarry's inventory."
				"To prevent lag, Ex-Fluids will be placed around fluids to prevent them from flowing."
				""
				"It costs a little over 150⚡ to mine each block."
				""
				"Without upgrades, it accepts only up to HV current."
				""
				"By default, the Quarry only mines a 7x7 area. You can increase this using Landmarks."
				"Place up to 3 Landmarks to set the boundary, and place the Quarry so it's inline with all of them."
			]
