		{
			dependencies: [
				"1368C642EDAA80D6"
				"4A11A7B99E4AB4A0"
			]
			description: [
				"FTBIC's &l&nNuclear Reactor&r is used to generate a lot of energy."
				""
				"The Nuclear Reactor's GUI has 9x6 inventory slots, 2 gauges, and 2 buttons."
				"The top gauge shows the ⚡/t being generated, and the bottom shows the Reactor's current &eheat&r."
				""
				"The first button allows you to simulate the Reactor, using the Reactor's contents. This tells you: "
				"● How long the Reactor will run"
				"● If the Reactor will explode, and the explosion radius"
				"● The ⚡/t generated"
				"● The total ⚡ generated"
				"&4● &lNOTE : DON'T USE THIS BUTTON &r&4when using Eternal Fuel. It will crash your game !"
				""
				"The second button pauses/unpauses the Reactor."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If &l&eHeat&r reaches 10,000, the Reactor will explode. The faster it was heating (heat/s), the bigger the explosion."
				""
				"{image:techev:textures/misc/quests/ftbic/nuke.png width:150 height:131 align:1}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Here's an example of a good setup of Nuclear Reactor :"
				""
				"{image:techev:textures/misc/quests/ftbic/reactor_setup_basic.png width:150 height:113 align:1}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Here's an example of a good setup of Nuclear Reactor using Eternal Stellas :"
				""
				"{image:techev:textures/misc/quests/ftbic/reactor_setup_stella.png width:150 height:113 align:1}"
				""
				"Eternal Stellas will make Fuel Rods and Vents &eunbreakable&r, so basically the reactor will never stop,"
