			description: [
				"&l&nUranium Fuel Rods&r generate Zaps and Heat. Zaps are good, &eHeat&r is bad."
				""
				"Fuel Rods work much faster when they're next to other Fuel Rods. Fuel Rods gain 5⚡/t per adjacent Fuel Rod. Two adjacent Fuel Rods will go from 5⚡/t each to 10⚡/t each, for a total of 20⚡/t."
				""
				"However, &eHeat also raises dramatically&r. The equation is a bit more complex:"
				""
				"➥ n(n+1)*r"
